* {{audio|de|De-Hafen.ogg|audio}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|de|gml|havene}}. The word was already borrowed into {{der|de|gmh|habene}}; the modern form with {{m|de||-f-}} is a later adaptation once again based on the Middle Low German form. Ultimately from {{der|de|gem-pro|*habnō}}. Cognate to {{cog|nl|haven}} and {{cog|en|haven}}.

